{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type FourModifierHotkey = `Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L72","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:72"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Four modifier + key combinations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only the canonical "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control+Alt+Shift+Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" combination is included."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Why no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" combinations?"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nSince "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" resolves to either "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" (Windows/Linux) or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" (macOS), any\nfour-modifier combination with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" would create duplicate modifiers on one platform.\nFor example:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Control+Alt+Shift"},{"type":"text","value":" → duplicates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" on Windows/Linux"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Alt+Shift+Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" → duplicates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" on macOS"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype FourModifierHotkey = `Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:72](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L72)\n\nFour modifier + key combinations.\n\nOnly the canonical `Control+Alt+Shift+Meta` combination is included.\n\n**Why no `Mod` combinations?**\nSince `Mod` resolves to either `Control` (Windows/Linux) or `Meta` (macOS), any\nfour-modifier combination with `Mod` would create duplicate modifiers on one platform.\nFor example:\n- `Mod+Control+Alt+Shift` → duplicates `Control` on Windows/Linux\n- `Mod+Alt+Shift+Meta` → duplicates `Meta` on macOS\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FourModifierHotkey\ntitle: FourModifierHotkey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype FourModifierHotkey = `Control+Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:72](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L72)\n\nFour modifier + key combinations.\n\nOnly the canonical `Control+Alt+Shift+Meta` combination is included.\n\n**Why no `Mod` combinations?**\nSince `Mod` resolves to either `Control` (Windows/Linux) or `Meta` (macOS), any\nfour-modifier combination with `Mod` would create duplicate modifiers on one platform.\nFor example:\n- `Mod+Control+Alt+Shift` → duplicates `Control` on Windows/Linux\n- `Mod+Alt+Shift+Meta` → duplicates `Meta` on macOS\n"}
